# Language Test 202505 - ABC083B: Some Sums
Kalivisku musope kas digit_sum vis x {
    Sonome kas total tas 0.
    Pilike palusta x > 0 {
        total += x % 10.
        x //= 10.
    }
    Jasepe kas total.
}
Sonome kas N kasta A kasta B tas Kisite kas readints vis 3.
Sonome kas answer tas 0.
Sonome kas s tas 0.
Pilike kas x pas Kisite kas pilika vis 1 kasta N + 1 {
    Kemese kas s tas Kisite kas digit_sum vis x.
    Palusta s >= A kasta s <= B {
        answer += x.
    }
}
Takute kas answer.
